Alert, the /movemyself and /givemyself commands have been shortened. You can use the /mv command instead of /movemyself, /gv instead of /givemyself. The /movemyself and /givemyself commands still work, they have been shortened just for convenience.
The death_free_card item has been temporarily activated for the event! It will be removed after the event is over.
Our new event has started!
In this event, you can teleport yourself from anywhere to anywhere on an existing map, you can give yourself as many items as you want!
If there is a command that you want to be added, do not hesitate to contact us!
The commands are specified below:
/givemyself or /gv item name amount. It will give you the item you have written  with amount.
/movemyself or /mv x, y, and z courdinates. It moves you to an existing location on the map that you are in.
Today is December 15th, and all the characters, maps, and teams on the server are backed up. We will be back to the backup on December 15 after the event is over! Enjoy the event! And thank you for staying with us!
*Old messages:
Guys, there is a small problem, sometimes, you can't jump, if it happens to you, please restart your client. You can go offline and press enter the restart the game option to restart your client easily. Thank you!
Now there is a telegram bot for our game, thanks to this bot, you can reset your password, reset your email, get automatic help, send a help request, you can also donate new sounds, or new codes, those who want to try, @ek_gamers_support_bot
Our new Telegram channel was opened where we will share news about for the EK game, don't forget to join:
https://t.me/ek_gamers
Also we opened a new group for talking about for the EK or other topics, don't forget to join and check the rules:
https://t.me/ek_gamers_chat
*Old message:
EK is come back! But nothing was new currently. We are making a new update soon, which we will release it. Don't worry, we are come back with new maps and new ideas!
Since the game has been reopened, for this reason, all characters, shelters and teams have been deleted! You need to reopen it again. If you found a bug, please let us know.
If you want to help us about for map building or if you made a bgt code to share with us, just send a message in telegram @istek2! Also in the f7 menu you can send your suggestions.
Share this game with your friends:
http://buzreisi-productions.tk/ek/ek.rar
If you have the release, but your ek.exe is not working, download this exe and replace with your current ek.exe:
http://buzreisi-productions.tk/ek/exe
Enjoy and have fun!
